0..75 Comment "// A program guards on its environment: it reads a variable and chooses its"
76..150 Comment "// exit code by whether the variable is set. The lowering admits no member"
151..185 Comment "// selection on a host module yet."
186..188 Comment "//"
189..230 Comment "// - see: #1106 — `exit_by_environment`"
232..307 Comment "/// The guard: a variable no environment sets reads as the empty string, so"
308..341 Comment "/// it answers the exit code `3`."
